	    SYNTAX          DOspfv2DistanceEntry
	    MAX-ACCESS      not-accessible
	    STATUS          current
	    DESCRIPTION
	       "An entry contains the administrative distance configuration."
	    INDEX {  
	        dOspfv2DistanceType
	    }
	    ::= { dOspfv2DistanceTable 1 }
    
